abstract: >-
  ClockBind is an open-source statistics studio with a command-line interface and a local point-and-click app.
  It records the exact analysis specification, input and output hashes, software versions and code hash for every run,
  and each statistical procedure is validated against established reference implementations in R.
  Computations rely on established libraries (NumPy, SciPy, statsmodels; exploratory factor analysis is implemented in ClockBind on NumPy/SciPy; lavaan in R for confirmatory factor analysis).
